                            <path d="M430 67C424.477 67 420 71.4772 420 77V83H440V77C440 71.4772 435.523 67 430 67ZM424 83V77C424 73.6863 426.686 71 430 71C433.314 71 436 73.6863 436 77V83" fill="#FF7447"/>
                        </svg>
                    </div>

                    <section class="dashboard-stats" aria-label="Dashboard stats">
                        <article class="stat-box">
                            <span>&#128279; Total Links Created</span>
                            <strong id="total-links-stat">0</strong>
                        </article>
                        <article class="stat-box">
                            <span>&#128065; Total Clicks</span>
                            <strong id="total-clicks-stat">0</strong>
                        </article>
                        <article class="stat-box link-stat">
                            <span>&#128202; Most Popular Link</span>
                            <strong id="popular-link-stat">No data yet</strong>
                        </article>
                    </section>

                    <div class="welcome-box">
                        <span>Logged In As</span>
                        <strong id="welcome-user">User</strong>
                    </div>
                </section>

                <section class="dashboard-work">
                    <article class="card">
                        <h2>Shorten your URL</h2>
                        <p>Generate a short link from a full URL.</p>

                        <form id="shorten-form" class="form-grid">
                            <label class="field" for="url-input">
                                <span class="field-label">Long URL</span>
                                <input id="url-input" name="url" type="url" placeholder="https://example.com/your-long-link" required>
                            </label>

                            <div class="form-row">
                                <label class="field" for="alias-input">
                                    <span class="field-label">Custom Alias</span>
                                    <input id="alias-input" name="alias" type="text" placeholder="my-link" minlength="3" maxlength="30" pattern="[a-z0-9-]{3,30}">
                                    <span class="field-hint">Optional. Use lowercase letters, numbers, and hyphens.</span>
                                </label>

                                <section class="expiry-panel" aria-labelledby="expiry-label">
                                    <input id="expiry-input" name="expiresAt" type="hidden">
                                    <div class="expiry-head">
                                        <div>
                                            <span id="expiry-label" class="field-label">Expiry</span>
                                            <span class="field-hint">Choose how long this link should stay active.</span>
                                        </div>
                                        <span id="expiry-summary" class="expiry-summary">Permanent</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="expiry-options" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Link expiry">
                                        <button type="button" class="expiry-option active" data-expiry-option="never" aria-pressed="true">
                                            <strong>No expiry</strong>
                                            <span>Permanent link</span>
                                        </button>
                                        <button type="button" class="expiry-option" data-expiry-option="1d" aria-pressed="false">
                                            <strong>24 hours</strong>
                                            <span>Short campaign</span>
                                        </button>
                                        <button type="button" class="expiry-option" data-expiry-option="7d" aria-pressed="false">
                                            <strong>7 days</strong>
                                            <span>Weekly share</span>
                                        </button>
                                        <button type="button" class="expiry-option" data-expiry-option="30d" aria-pressed="false">
                                            <strong>30 days</strong>
                                            <span>Monthly link</span>
                                        </button>
                                    </div>
                                </section>
                            </div>
                            <p class="helper-text">Choose a readable alias when you want a memorable link, or leave the extras blank for a quick random short URL.</p>

                            <button type="submit" class="submit-button">Generate Short URL</button>
                        </form>

                        <p id="shorten-status" class="status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>

                        <section id="shorten-result" class="result-card" hidden>
                            <span class="section-label">Generated Link</span>
                            <div class="result-row">
                                <span class="result-prefix">Short URL:</span>
                                <a id="short-link" class="result-link" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"></a>
                            </div>
                            <p id="original-url" class="original-url"></p>
                            <div class="result-meta">
                                <span id="short-id-output" class="meta-chip"></span>
                                <span id="expiry-output" class="meta-chip"></span>
                            </div>

                            <div class="actions">
                                <button type="button" id="copy-link" class="secondary-button">Copy</button>
                                <a id="open-link" class="button-link" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Open</a>
                                <button type="button" id="use-for-analytics" class="secondary-button">Get Analytics</button>
                            </div>
                        </section>
                    </article>

                    <article class="card">
                        <div class="card-header">
                            <div>
                                <h2>Your Recent Links</h2>
                                <p>Keep your latest short URLs ready to open, copy, and share after refresh.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div id="saved-links-empty" class="empty-history">Your created links will appear here after you generate them.</div>
                        <section id="saved-links-list" class="saved-links-list" hidden></section>
                    </article>

                    <article class="card">
                        <h2>Track your link performance in real-time &#128202;</h2>
                        <p>View click count and visit history.</p>

                        <form id="analytics-form" class="form-grid">
                            <label class="field" for="analytics-input">
                                Short ID or Short URL
                                <input id="analytics-input" name="shortId" type="text" placeholder="abc12 or http://localhost:5001/abc12" required>
                            </label>

                            <button type="submit" class="submit-button">Fetch Analytics</button>
                        </form>

                        <p id="analytics-status" class="status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>

                        <section id="analytics-result" class="analytics-result" hidden>
                            <span class="section-label">Analytics Result</span>

                            <div class="analytics-summary">
                                <div class="stat-box">
                                    <span>Short Path</span>
                                    <strong id="analytics-path">/url/</strong>
                                </div>
                                <div class="stat-box">
                                    <span>Total Clicks</span>
                                    <strong id="analytics-clicks">0</strong>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="actions">
                                <a id="analytics-open-link" class="button-link" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Open Short Link</a>
                                <button type="button" id="analytics-copy-link" class="secondary-button">Copy Short Link</button>
                                <a id="analytics-json" class="button-link" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Open Analytics JSON</a>
                            </div>

                            <div id="analytics-empty" class="empty-history" hidden>No visits recorded yet for this short URL.</div>
                            <ul id="analytics-history" class="timeline"></ul>
                        </section>
                    </article>

                </section>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="view-shell seo-section">
            <div class="seo-layout">
                <div>
                    <span class="pill">Why urlzap</span>
                    <h2>Free URL Shortener for Students &amp; Developers</h2>
                    <p>
                        urlzap.me is a free URL shortener for students and developers who need to shorten long links instantly.
                        Use it to shorten render links, assignment URLs, portfolio links, project demos, and form links before sharing them anywhere.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Whether you are posting in WhatsApp, Telegram, email, or an event group, urlzap helps you shorten long links into clean short URLs
                        that are easier to copy, easier to remember, and better for sharing.
                    </p>
                    <p class="seo-note">
                        This url shortener for students also gives you analytics, so you can review clicks, understand activity, and manage short links from one simple dashboard.
                    </p>

                    <nav class="seo-links" aria-label="SEO pages">
                        <a href="/about">About</a>
                        <a href="/how-it-works">How It Works</a>
                        <a href="/features">Features</a>
                    </nav>
                </div>

                <div class="seo-card-grid">
                    <article class="seo-card">
                        <h3>For assignments and projects</h3>
                        <p>Share classroom work, portfolio links, and project submissions with shorter URLs that look cleaner and feel more professional.</p>
                    </article>
                    <article class="seo-card">
                        <h3>For Render and Vercel links</h3>
                        <p>Long deployment URLs can be messy. Use urlzap to shorten render links and keep product demos easier to send.</p>
                    </article>
                    <article class="seo-card">
                        <h3>For messaging apps</h3>
                        <p>Clean links are easier to send in WhatsApp and Telegram, especially when you want the message itself to stay readable.</p>
                    </article>
                    <article class="seo-card">
                        <h3>For event sharing</h3>
                        <p>Turn long Google Forms and registration pages into compact links that are easier to place on posters, bios, and event messages.</p>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

